#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:6
msgid ""
"Generate a self-signed x509v3 certificate for use with multiple URLs / "
"IPs. See the [configure SAML 2.0 with Okta for "
"Mattermost](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/onboard/sso-"
"saml-okta.html#before-you-begin) documentation for details on generating "
"encryption certificates for encrypting the SAML connection."
msgstr ""
"여러 URL/IP에 사용할 자체 서명 x509v3 인증서를 생성합니다. SAML 연결 암호화를 위한 "
"암호화 인증서 생성에 대한 자세한 내용은 [Okta로 Mattermost SAML 2.0 "
"구성](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/onboard/sso-"
"saml-okta.html#before-you-begin) 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:8
msgid "Generate Certificates"
msgstr "인증서 생성"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:10
msgid "Default values"
msgstr "기본값"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:16
msgid "Custom values"
msgstr "사용자 지정 값"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:18
msgid ""
"You may change the `CRT_CN` and `CRT_SAN` values of the above command "
"based on your needs."
msgstr ""
"필요에 따라 위 명령의 `CRT_CN`과 `CRT_SAN` 값을 변경할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:20
msgid "Additionally you may use any of the following environment variables :"
msgstr "추가로 다음 환경 변수를 사용할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:21
msgid ""
"`CRT_FILENAME`: the name of the cert and key files i.e. "
"`<CRT_FILENAME>.key` and `<CRT_FILENAME>.crt`"
msgstr ""
"`CRT_FILENAME`: 인증서·키 파일의 이름. 즉 `<CRT_FILENAME>.key`와 "
"`<CRT_FILENAME>.crt`"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:22
msgid "`CRT_C` : Country value"
msgstr "`CRT_C` : 국가(Country) 값"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:23
msgid "`CRT_L` : Locality value"
msgstr "`CRT_L` : 지역(Locality) 값"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:24
msgid "`CRT_O` : Organization value"
msgstr "`CRT_O` : 조직(Organization) 값"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:25
msgid "`CRT_OU` : Organizational Unit value"
msgstr "`CRT_OU` : 조직 단위(Organizational Unit) 값"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:26
msgid "`CRT_CN` : Common Name value"
msgstr "`CRT_CN` : 일반 이름(Common Name) 값"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:27
msgid "`CRT_SAN` : SubjectAltName value"
msgstr "`CRT_SAN` : SubjectAltName 값"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:29
msgid "Result"
msgstr "결과"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:31
msgid "The command will generate two files:"
msgstr "이 명령은 두 개의 파일을 생성합니다:"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:32
msgid "pkcs#8 private key : `mattermost-x509.key` (unless you set `CRT_FILENAME`)"
msgstr "pkcs#8 개인 키 : `mattermost-x509.key` (`CRT_FILENAME`을 설정하지 않은 경우)"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:33
msgid "x509v3 certificate : `mattermost-x509.crt` (unless you set `CRT_FILENAME`)"
msgstr "x509v3 인증서 : `mattermost-x509.crt` (`CRT_FILENAME`을 설정하지 않은 경우)"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:35
msgid ""
"You can confirm the certificate content by using the following standard "
"`x509` command:"
msgstr ""
"다음 표준 `x509` 명령으로 인증서 내용을 확인할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:41
msgid "Secure/Unsecure Certificates"
msgstr "인증서 보안 설정/해제"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:43
msgid "The generated private key is passwordless by default."
msgstr "생성된 개인 키는 기본적으로 비밀번호가 없습니다."

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:45
msgid "You can secure/unsecure the certificates using standard `pkcs8` commands:"
msgstr "표준 `pkcs8` 명령으로 인증서의 보안을 설정하거나 해제할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:55
msgid "Additional Reading"
msgstr "추가 읽을거리"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:57
msgid "Below are additional guides and documentation for optional reading:"
msgstr "아래는 선택적으로 읽어 볼 추가 가이드와 문서입니다:"

#: ../../source/scripts/generate-certificates/gencert.md:58
msgid ""
"[SubjectAltName page on "
"wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SubjectAltName)"
msgstr ""
"[위키백과의 SubjectAltName 문서](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SubjectAltName)"

